  "contentHtml": "<p>3년만에 처음으로 롯데월드로 현장체험학습을 갔다 왔습니다!</p><p>더 알찬 체험학습을 위해 과학수업과 연계하여, 놀이기구의 과학적 원리에 대해 수업하였습니다~~</p><p>요즘 놀이공원 가는 학교들이 많을 것 같아 부족한 자료이지만 올려봅니다^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>전공이 물리가 아니라 열심히 인터넷 검색하며 가능한 간단하게 내용 정리하였는데,</p><p>혹시 틀린 내용 있으면 알려주세요!^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수업 pdf 파일과 학생 활동지 올려드립니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/172b1b47dd715c3c43b448ffc2e02d796ed3fe67\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/172b1b47dd715c3c43b448ffc2e02d796ed3fe67\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/491ccf2c94dbf9c64e1463a07331961131e166fe\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/491ccf2c94dbf9c64e1463a07331961131e166fe\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3805619234967e4bc162338806787e1d7cc69389\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3805619234967e4bc162338806787e1d7cc69389\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d51222a5cf08984471fdfcfbe81f693428744e40?download\" data-file-name=\"놀이공원에서 배우는 과학 원리.pdf\" data-file-size=\"10302062\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D703%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20220502134619&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd51222a5cf08984471fdfcfbe81f693428744e40')\"><div cl